{#- What the assigned NPC has of earlier scenes (spec 11): what it was there
    for, and what it was established to know. Rendered only from the view's
    visible slices; nothing here is anyone else's.
    Vars: history_actor_name (str), and history_blocks ([str]) or
    history_known ([EvidenceItem]). -#}
{%- set blocks = history_blocks if history_blocks is defined else [] -%}
{%- if history_blocks is not defined -%}
{%- for item in history_known -%}
{%- set block -%}{%- include "scene/sections/history_item.j2" -%}{%- endset -%}
{%- set _ = blocks.append(block.strip()) -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if blocks %}# What {{ history_actor_name }} remembers or knows

Being there means what {{ history_actor_name }} could see or hear, never another person's private thoughts.

{{ blocks | join("\n\n") }}{% endif -%}
